# Titanic Survival Prediction

## Project Overview
This project uses Machine Learning to predict whether a Titanic passenger survived or not.

## Model
A Decision Tree Classifier was trained using the Titanic dataset.

## Features
- Passenger Class (pclass)
- Sex
- Age
- Fare

## Model Accuracy
The model achieved approximately 79.72% accuracy on the test dataset.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Streamlit
- Joblib

## Files
- app.py - Streamlit application
- model.joblib - Trained machine learning model
- requirements.txt - Required Python libraries

## How to Run
Install the required libraries:

pip install -r requirements.txt

Then run:

streamlit run app.py
